  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/Bacon.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025193433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Bacon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Bacon</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal good</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 10</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 50</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  4 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Pig</span><span title=\"Pig(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/pig-2491\" title=\"Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pig\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 14</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 7</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Bacon</b> is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animal good</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 10.\n</p><p>It is used to make many recipes as well as feed <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-dogs-7570\" title=\"Category:Dogs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">dogs</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-puppies-18403\" title=\"Category:Puppies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">puppies</a>. It is one of the most used products in the game.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Collecting bacon</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b1/Pig_Steaming.png/revision/latest?cb=20260514211727\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Steaming a pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Steaming a pig\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"209\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Steaming a pig</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Bacon is collected from <a href=\"/wiki/pig-2491\" title=\"Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pigs</a> which have been fed <a href=\"/wiki/pig-feed-2094\" title=\"Pig Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pig feed</a>. Once fed, pigs need 4 hours to get fatter. Players can then put them in a steaming machine to get bacon.\n</p><p>Collecting bacon gives players 5 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling bacon</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside Shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Bacon can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 504 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 units.</li>\n<li>A <a href=\"/wiki/pig-2491\" title=\"Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pig</a> costs between 500 and 2,300 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and a <a href=\"/wiki/pig-pen-2719\" title=\"Pig Pen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pig pen</a> 150 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using bacon</b></span></h3>\n<p>Bacon is used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>:\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-and-eggs-2069\" title=\"Bacon and eggs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon and eggs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-pie-2308\" title=\"Bacon pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/hamburger-2277\" title=\"Hamburger\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hamburger\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-and-eggs-2069\" title=\"Bacon and Eggs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bacon and Eggs</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-pie-2308\" title=\"Bacon Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bacon Pie</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/hamburger-2277\" title=\"Hamburger\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hamburger</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/Bacon.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025193433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/Bacon.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025193433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/Bacon.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025193433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x2</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 11\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 18\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/casserole-2695\" title=\"Casserole\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Casserole\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/shepherd-s-pie-2703\" title=\"Shepherd&amp;#39;s pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shepherd&amp;#39;s pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/blt-salad-8965\" title=\"BLT salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"BLT salad\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/casserole-2695\" title=\"Casserole\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Casserole</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/shepherd-s-pie-2703\" title=\"Shepherd&amp;#39;s Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shepherd's Pie</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/blt-salad-8965\" title=\"BLT Salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BLT Salad</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/Bacon.png/revision/latest?cb=2019102519343